      "writtenOn": "2024-05-10T03:48:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I understand why the type-c only timer would need to be reset for this path. However, there can\u0027t be a hard reset sent/received in a type-c only connection. I don\u0027t think there should be a check for hard_reset_sent here.\n\nThe reason this flag is set is that currently the change status bits from connector status have `pd reset complete` set always.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1947,
        "startChar": 5,
        "endLine": 1952,
        "endChar": 49
      },
      "revId": "992304a33b4cd913805c5231f68146c343eac636",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "9973eeda_35420be4",
        "filename": "zephyr/subsys/pd_controller/pdc_power_mgmt.c",
